{"quest_id": 6184, "name": "真夏の夜の出会い", "description": "夏祭りも終わりを迎える最中、\n夜の静寂を破る魔物の声。\n乱入者を倒し、祭りに幕を下ろせ！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "戦場の記憶～追憶の章～", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920094, "map_no": 5219, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 31, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 48}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 57}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2111136, "race_id": 9, "change_to": 4, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 30461, "global_id": 4080, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 4081, "spawn_sec": 87}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3600, "attack": 135, "base_hp": 3600, "base_attack": 135, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 45, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 12, "attack_interval": 42, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111056, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 54, "master_id": 30462, "global_id": 4081, "from_condition": 2}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 4500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 120, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 23, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 48, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097312, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 53, "global_id": 52, "spawn_sec": 103}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、夏祭りも盛況の内に終わりました。\n踊りに、肝試しに、余興に……皆さん、\n楽しんで頂けたみたいで何よりです。"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "戦時中でのささやかなお祭りでしたが、\n激戦続きの兵たちにとって、\n良い慰安になったかと思います。"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あれだけ賑やかだったのが、嘘のようですね。\n……少し、寂しい気もします。", "face": "le02648efb8c0"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "――王子、魔物が接近中との報告です！！\nゴブリンの群れが間もなく、こちらまで到来します！", "face": "l691c92aa102a"}, {"name": "魔物", "text": "ギャギャ！　オマツリ！　オマツリ！", "face": "le2c5c8732e67"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "祭りの後の静けさにはまだ早いようですね。\n王子、応戦をお願いします！", "face": "l09e714fb7b3c"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ケイティ", "text": "今ので魔物は全て討伐できたようですね。\n……ん、アレは？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "――ちょっと離して！　離しなさいよ！！", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "おう王子、怪しい奴がいたんで、とっ捕まえておいたぜ。\nゴブリンに変装して、店の食い物を狙ってやがった。", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "くっ……リンゴ飴に気を取られた挙句、\n捕まっちゃうなんて……。\nこの義賊サヨ、一生の不覚だわ！", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "サヨさん……と言うのですか？\nあの、サヨさんはどうしてゴブリンに変装など？", "face": "l09e714fb7b3c"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "……年貢の納め時ってやつかしらね。\nそうね、長い話になりそうだし\nどこか落ち着いて話せる場所に移動しない？", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……どうやら逃げる気はないようですね。\n判りました。サヨさん、こちらへどうぞ。"}]}], "active": true}